	["quest.boss_grimrok.title"] = "Grimrok's Bane",
	["quest.boss_grimrok.p1"] = "Grimrok has gathered the goblins of the whole Meadows under one spear. A chief who can count to a hundred is a chief who starts planning raids on the farms.",
	["quest.boss_grimrok.p2"] = "His lair is in Mosshollow Cave, the deepest cave of the Meadows. Go down into the dungeon and bring him down. The captaincy pays for the chief's first head, and I want to see it with my own eyes.",
	["quest.boss_grimrok.progress"] = "Defeat Grimrok in the dungeon of Mosshollow Cave and return to Scout Mira.",
	["quest.boss_grimrok.done"] = "Without a chief the goblins will fight over the loot before they fight over anything else. The Meadows can breathe. Take this, the captaincy keeps its word.",
	["quest.boss_morvane.title"] = "Morvane's Bane",
	["quest.boss_morvane.p1"] = "Morvane rules the dead of Duskwood. Every night more of them walk out of the Crypt of the Forgotten, and the lanterns go out one by one.",
	["quest.boss_morvane.p2"] = "The crypt is the last cave of the forest. Go down to its bottom and break the queen's hold. The captaincy will reward the first victory over her.",
	["quest.boss_morvane.progress"] = "Defeat Morvane in the Crypt of the Forgotten and return to Scout Borin.",
	["quest.boss_morvane.done"] = "I heard the crypt fall silent. The dead will go back to sleep, at least for a while. You have earned your reward.",
	["quest.boss_azgor.title"] = "Azgor's Bane",
	["quest.boss_azgor.p1"] = "Azgor stokes the forges where the orcs make weapons for the whole Wastes. As long as his fire burns, their war will not end.",
	["quest.boss_azgor.p2"] = "He sits in Deepforge, the last cave of the Wastes, above a river of lava. Put him out. The captaincy will pay for the first win.",
	["quest.boss_azgor.progress"] = "Defeat Azgor in Deepforge and return to Scout Kesra.",
	["quest.boss_azgor.done"] = "The smoke above the forge is thinning. The orcs have lost their master and we have gained time. Here is your pay.",
	["quest.boss_vaelgrath.title"] = "Vaelgrath's Bane",
	["quest.boss_vaelgrath.p1"] = "Vaelgrath, the Frost Dragon, is waking in the Glacier Heart. His roar carries over all of Frostpeak, and the snow beneath him does not melt even in fire.",
	["quest.boss_vaelgrath.p2"] = "The Glacier Heart is the last cave of the peaks. No one has yet come back from there with a dragon's scale. If you do, the captaincy will reward it like no other victory.",
	["quest.boss_vaelgrath.progress"] = "Defeat Vaelgrath in the Glacier Heart and return to Scout Halvar.",
	["quest.boss_vaelgrath.done"] = "The mountains are silent for the first time in years. I will tell of it in every watchtower. Take your reward, you have earned it.",
